### Chat History Management API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@workspaceId = YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID_HERE
@chatId = YOUR_CHAT_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new chat history
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get all chat histories for workspace (non-archived)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get all chat histories including archived
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chats?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get messages for a chat (first page, 50 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get messages with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Add new user message
POST {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "What is the main topic of this document?",
  "isUserMessage": true,
  "references": null
}

### 7. Add new assistant message with references
POST {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Based on the document, the main topic is...",
  "isUserMessage": false,
  "references": "[{\"pdf\": \"document.pdf\", \"page\": 5}, {\"pdf\": \"document.pdf\", \"page\": 7}]"
}

### 8. Archive a chat
PUT {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Delete a chat history
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
